The central architectural concept of Vyra is the Compliance Digital Twin.

The Compliance Digital Twin is a continuously evolving representation of organizational compliance posture.

It models:

* Regulatory obligations
* Controls
* Operational systems
* Assets
* Vendors
* Signals
* Risks
* Decisions
* Remediations
* Assurance outcomes

The Digital Twin serves as the living model of compliance reality.

