# From Observability To Explainability

Visibility alone is insufficient.

Organizations must be able to explain:

* Why a control failed
* Why a risk exists
* Why a decision was made
* Why an assurance statement is valid

This requirement drives one of Vyra's defining capabilities:

Traceability Intelligence.

Every compliance outcome must be traceable.

Every decision must be explainable.

Every assurance statement must be verifiable.

Every incident must be reconstructable.

Vyra achieves this through continuous lineage across obligations, controls, operational signals, risks, remediations, and assurance outcomes.

This transforms compliance from a reporting activity into an explainable system.

